#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_BrendansHouse_2F/scripts.inc:272
msgctxt "PlayersHouse_2F_Text_ClockIsStopped"
msgid ""
"The clock is stopped…\p"
"Better set it and start it!$"
msgstr ""
"时钟停住了……\p"
"把时间调好，让它走起来吧！$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_BrendansHouse_2F/scripts.inc:276
msgctxt "PlayersHouse_2F_Text_HowDoYouLikeYourRoom"
msgid ""
"MOM: {PLAYER}, how do you like your\n"
"new room?\p"
"Good! Everything's put away neatly!\p"
"They finished moving everything in\n"
"downstairs, too.\p"
"POKéMON movers are so convenient!\p"
"Oh, you should make sure that\n"
"everything's all there on your desk.$"
msgstr ""
"妈妈：{PLAYER}，你觉得\n"
"新房间怎么样？\p"
"很好！东西都收拾得整整齐齐！\p"
"楼下的东西也全都搬好了。\p"
"宝可梦搬家公司真是太方便了！\p"
"对了，你最好确认一下书桌上的\n"
"东西有没有少。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_BrendansHouse_2F/scripts.inc:286
msgctxt "PlayersHouse_2F_Text_Notebook"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} flipped open the notebook.\p"
"ADVENTURE RULE NO. 1\n"
"Open the MENU with START.\p"
"ADVENTURE RULE NO. 2\n"
"Record your progress with SAVE.\p"
"The remaining pages are blank…$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}翻开了笔记本。\p"
"冒险守则第1条\n"
"按START键打开菜单。\p"
"冒险守则第2条\n"
"用“记录”保存冒险进度。\p"
"剩下的几页都是空白的……$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_BrendansHouse_2F/scripts.inc:294
msgctxt "Common_Text_LookCloserAtMap"
msgid ""
"{PLAYER} took a closer look at the\n"
"{REGION} region map.$"
msgstr ""
"{PLAYER}仔细看了看\n"
"{REGION}地区的地图。$"

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_BrendansHouse_2F/scripts.inc:298
msgctxt "PlayersHouse_2F_Text_ItsAGameCube"
msgid ""
"It's a Nintendo GameCube.\p"
"A Game Boy Advance is connected to\n"
"serve as the Controller.$"
msgstr ""
"是一台任天堂GameCube。\p"
"连接着一台Game Boy Advance，\n"
"用来当作手柄。$"
